  "title": "Sixteenth Century Orange Chicken",
  "description": "Chicken breast braised in a sauce of oranges, prunes, dates, currants and cloves simmered with rose water and white wine; there is a fruity, delicate sweetness to this recipe from a 1594 kitchen guide.",
  "authors": [
    "Talia"
  ],
